  "prefLabel": "He-W 568.06 Prior Authorization",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-12-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 568.06 Prior Authorization.\n\n(a) The provider shall request prior authorization, as specified in He-W 530, for therapy services prescribed in excess of the limits described in He-W 568.04.\n\n(b) Providers of hearing aid services and devices shall request prior authorization in accordance with He-W 567.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #4995, eff 11-30-90, EXPIRED: 11-30-96\n\nNew. #7909, eff 6-24-03; ss by #9929, INTERIM, eff 6-19-11, EXPIRES: 12-16-11; ss by #10042, eff 12-16-11; ss by #13355, eff 3-19-22",
